Boring Remote is a modified version of RustDesk.

RustDesk is Copyright (C) Purslane Tech Pte. Ltd. and the RustDesk contributors.
It is licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License, version 3. Boring
Remote is too. The license is in the LICENCE file.

Boring Labs has been modifying this work since 2026-10-22. The base is RustDesk
1.6.4 (the version in Cargo.toml).

What changed: the boring/ folder and flutter/lib/desktop/kit/ are new, and so
are the other files listed in boring/REBASE.md. boring/rebrand.py patches the
rest of the tree at build time. Upstream copyright headers and LICENCE are as
RustDesk left them.

To build: python3 boring/rebrand.py, then follow
.github/workflows/boring-build.yml.
